        "created_at": "2024-07-03T10:57:00.114Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In output redirection, if the descriptor is repeated, only the last one is considered, and any preceding ones are ignored.</p>\n<p>Here <code>&gt;out</code> will be ignored in favor of <code>1&gt;&amp;2</code>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>&gt;out</code> is essentially <code>1&gt;out</code> (default behavior).</li>\n<li><code>1&gt;&amp;2</code> will send <code>stdout</code> to <code>stderr</code> which is printed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Do note that the file <code>out</code> will still be created or replaced.</p>",
