  "accepted_answer": {
    "post_number": 2,
    "username": "22F3002354",
    "name": null,
    "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/22f3002354/{size}/69454_2.png",
    "excerpt": "<p>In output redirection, if the descriptor is repeated, only the last one is considered, and any preceding ones are ignored.</p>\n<p>Here <code>&gt;out</code> will be ignored in favor of <code>1&gt;&amp;2</code>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>&gt;out</code> is essentially <code>1&gt;out</code> (default behavior).</li>\n<li><code>1&gt;&amp;2</code> will send <code>stdout</code> to <code>stderr</code> which is printed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Do note that the file <code>out</code> will still be created or replaced.</p>",
    "accepter_name": null,
    "accepter_username": "RishiPatel"
  },
